      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "It can be difficult to decide whether or not there was or is an act against the rules of animal protection. Therefore it is important, to determine both on the animal and/or on the existing situation, whether or not the well-being of the animal was or is disturbed. In order to ascertain this several guidelines are recommended."},
